### Newsletter lists (EMAIL_NOTIFY)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tenantHost = localhost:8080

### List lists
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/newsletter-lists
Host: {{tenantHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminAccessToken}}

### Create list
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/newsletter-lists
Host: {{tenantHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "weekly",
  "name": "Weekly",
  "description": "Weekly digest"
}

### Public subscribe (no auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/newsletter-lists/weekly/subscribe
Host: {{tenantHost}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reader@example.com"
}

### Attach lists to article draft
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/articles/{{articleId}}/newsletter-lists
Host: {{tenantHost}}
Authorization: Bearer {{editorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newsletterListIds": [1]
}

### Confirm (token from Mailpit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/newsletter/confirm
Host: {{tenantHost}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{confirmToken}}"
}

### Unsubscribe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/newsletter/unsubscribe
Host: {{tenantHost}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{unsubscribeToken}}"
}
